	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Salutem in domino.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Dominus diriget/dirigat corda Civitatum, quo nihil <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>adprobent, quam quod consonum sit verbo domini puro.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Varii sparguntur rumores de missa papist[ic]a invehenda in <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>nostras Civitates.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Sunt varię practicę a Caesareanis; verum <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>dominus absque dubio dissipabit eas, si nos veram pęnitentiam egerimus.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Quid <placeName ref="l491">Argentinę</placeName> agatur, in ista scheda inclusa invenies, dein <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>quid in <placeName ref="l749">Saxonia</placeName>; quas schedas cupio remitti cum tua oratione, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>quam habuisti contra Interim, et si quid praeterea habes, quod <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>contra Interim ab aliis sit scriptum, oro, velis communicare.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Senatus noster ea, quae propositurus est paganis, nobis praelegit; <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>nos non potuimus ea comprobare.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">De hac re alias.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Raptim, <placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName> 1548. 28. Novembri<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>s in ipso prandio.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">D. <persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName>, <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName> et <persName ref="p7228">[Zving]<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>lium</persName> nomine meo salutabis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Tuus <lb xml:id="p1z16"/><persName ref="p1278">Gastiu<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>s</persName> ex animo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><persName ref="p467">Bucerus</persName> vos omnes salutat in domino.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Man sagt, der <persName ref="p7736">von Rosenberg</persName> und der <persName ref="p8034">von Heideg</persName> seyen <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>in kaiserlicher ach, item der von <placeName ref="l3562">Büchlingen</placeName>, der <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>graff sey <foreign xml:lang="la">deprehensus in adultero</foreign> und erschossen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Der keyser soll hefftig kranck sin, das mann in müsse <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ätzen; <foreign xml:lang="la">nunquam ita periculose laboravit.</foreign></s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Id a quodam nobili <lb xml:id="p1z23"/><placeName ref="l1273">Ensesheimensi</placeName> audivi, qui ex Buxlla ad nos venit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
